  "contentHtml": "<p>코로나19 상황에서 과학행사를 진행하였습니다:)</p><p>교과 (행사)시간에서 방과후 대회로 학사일정을 수정하여 3주간 학년별 등교일정에 맞추어 진행되었습니다ㅎ</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c7f8aa4c32c16207f35bde14f6765b0e27db63d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c7f8aa4c32c16207f35bde14f6765b0e27db63d\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&lt; 3학년 - 방음벽만들기 &gt;</p><p>과학선생님들과 집단지성으로 만든 문제, 예비실험과 시연을 반복했지만 결과가 확연히 보여질까 걱정되었던 과제였습니다.</p><p>방음벽이 아닌 확성벽을 만든 학생도 있었지만,</p><p>문제해결과정에서 재미와 흥미를 느꼈다는 학생들의 의견에 뿌듯했던 행사였습니다.</p><p>환경을 생각하여 이 문제는 앞으로 하지 않을 것 같지만, 교사와 학생 모두 인스턴트챌린지 였던 대회로 기억될 거 같아요!</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c650d737e342352b3ec96370f40d2cde373a37fb?download\" data-file-name=\"창의융합 문제_2021_3학년.hwp\" data-file-size=\"735232\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3D424t%26dataid%3D220%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20210502213942&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fc650d737e342352b3ec96370f40d2cde373a37fb')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">창의융합 문제_2021_3학년</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">718.00KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cf77aafd61f5a4179a49506fb4bb87854f624865?download\" data-file-name=\"창의융합 설계도_2021_3학년.hwp\" data-file-size=\"14336\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3D424t%26dataid%3D220%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20210502213942&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fcf77aafd61f5a4179a49506fb4bb87854f624865')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">창의융합 설계도_2021_3학년</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">14.00KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6f929e0a894cd98d037d234182769c41927c24db?download\" data-file-name=\"창의융합 채점표_2021_3학년.hwp\" data-file-size=\"37376\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3D424t%26dataid%3D220%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20210502213942&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F6f929e0a894cd98d037d234182769c41927c24db')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">창의융합 채점표_2021_3학년</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">36.50KB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;# 재료 5가지 중 4가지만 선택 # 소리 # 파동 # 조건</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/185051820802c7304e0fa7d4d472515f7c44ba49\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/185051820802c7304e0fa7d4d472515f7c44ba49\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fa02a31717e01f22fc89e52b8dc42c6a4889a4cc\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fa02a31717e01f22fc89e52b8dc42c6a4889a4cc\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/059c30453b7bc9bee582c63a7a69312adb7c5b0c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.n